CODE EVIDENCE (real findings from this repository — ground truth; derive from these, not from your own knowledge of any library):
- src/services/contentstack.ts :: options — This is the Contentstack SDK configuration object passed to contentstack.Stack(). It currently configures only the delivery token and production environment — no preview token or live_preview config. Enabling draft preview requires adding CONTENTSTACK_PREVIEW_TOKEN and CONTENTSTACK_PREVIEW_HOST env 

