# Output
I now have full confirmation from the code. The `options` object in `src/services/contentstack.ts` contains `api_key`, `delivery_token`, `environment`, `branch`, and `fetchOptions` — and is passed to `contentstack.Stack(options)`. No `live_preview` or preview-related env vars exist yet in the codebase; they would be new additions. Statements 1 and 5 inspect internal structures (the outgoing request, the Stack config object); statements 2, 3, and 4 observe the rendered surface.

